    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) is implemented to restrict access to authorized personnel, and audit logging tracks every system output. our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, holds the SecNumCloud qualification, ensuring that Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, infrastructure meets the required standards for sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU. holds means Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, can guarantee that all data will be hosted within the EU with no transfers outside the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, also have measures in place to ensure explainability and auditability of Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, outputs. our product, Atelier, is grounded in sources, allows retrieval trace, and has an audit log." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our product, Atelier, supports internal quality control and statutory audit review." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding regulatory obligations, our are familiar with professional secrecy requirements and have experience delivering solutions to clients bound by such obligations. our understand the importance of respecting auditor independence and separation of duties, as well as not undermining anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT). our solution is designed to respect the importance of respecting auditor independence and separation of duties, as well as not undermining anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT) while providing a non-decisional support tool for chartered accountants and statutory auditors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, our have control mapping in place that links our platform features to applicable obligations, allowing our to produce corresponding audit evidence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures that our solution complies with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these measures and certifications, I am confident that our solution can meet the client's stringent security and compliance requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires professional validation of deliverables (con10), compliance with regulatory requirements (con11, con12, con13), respecting professional secrecy and auditor independence (con20, con21, con22, con58), not undermining anti-money laundering obligations (con37), and compliance with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents (con38)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with all relevant regulatory frameworks, including GDPR, anti-money laundering regulations, and professional secrecy requirements? we have experience working with clients bound by professional secrecy, including regulated professions. we is familiar with the contractual expectations of such clients. we maintain we regulatory compliance through we Security & Compliance function, specifically monitoring obligations such as GDPR, professional secrecy, anti-money-laundering framework, and legal retention obligations for accounting documents.  we contractual framework ensures that we do not compromise we own or we tool's professional obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's requirements, we should flag potential risks related to ensuring strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, as well as compliance with GDPR and anti-money-laundering regulations. we are compliant with relevant regulatory frameworks, including GDPR, as indicated by we monitoring of such obligations. we professional liability insurance coverage is up to 10 million euros per claim, which provides a basis for addressing potential legal risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we must ensure that we contractual framework with the client explicitly addresses the client specific requirements regarding professional validation, regulatory compliance, and respect for professional secrecy and auditor independence. we administrative attestations are available, which can provide assurance of we compliance with social and fiscal obligations in France." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, it is crucial to carefully review the client's tender to ensure we meet all specified requirements and constraints, particularly those related to regulatory compliance and professional secrecy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client has a budget allocated to the project of 220,000 over 3 years (con50), with controlled annual operating cost (con51), and requires an approach that optimises costs while guaranteeing expected quality of service (con52)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and what cost-optimisation strategies can our propose to ensure our meet The client budgetary requirements while delivering a high-quality solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, the reference budget of 220,000 euros over 3 years is within our normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The breakdown of costs is estimated as 40% for one-off project costs in the first year and 60% for recurring run costs over 3 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our target gross margin range of 25% to 35%, our can estimate that our projected margin on this contract would fall within our target gross margin range of 25% to 35%, depending on how effectively our manage costs and deliver value to The client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs and meet The client budgetary requirements while ensuring a high-quality solution, our can propose the following strategies: our favor cost-efficient tiers and models that protect the gross margin and the predictability of recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our can suggest using the sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, which is noted as the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side. using would help in minimizing expenses related to hosting and inference, which are identified as main recurring cost drivers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By maintaining a three-year cost model that can be re-run if requirements or budget change, our can ensure flexibility and adaptability in our costing strategy, allowing for adjustments as needed to stay within the client's budget while delivering the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is also important to work closely with the solution architect to keep the configuration within the SME envelope while preserving an acceptable margin, thus ensuring that our financial management aligns with the project technical requirements and budget constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an intelligent assistance tool (req8), supporting daily activities (req9), retrieving regulatory and methodological information (req10), assisting in drafting professional documents (req11), handling client files (req12), ensuring continuity of missions (req13, req33), maintaining existing practices (req14), avoiding rupture in working methods (req15), validating deliverables (req16, req26), obtaining information consultation assistance (req17), having quick access to reliable up-to-date information (req18), obtaining information drawn from accounting standards tax doctrine and legal texts (req19), accessing information on collective bargaining agreements for payroll social (req20), obtaining contextualised answers (req21), having answers grounded in cited sources (req22), receiving drafting assistance (req23), assisting in drafting client letters and correspondence (req24), creating mission notes file memos and syntheses (req25)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How would you design the AI components of our solution to meet these requirements, ensuring our provide a high-quality, reliable, and efficient intelligent assistance tool that supports the client's professionals in the client's professionals daily activities?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements, you would design the AI components of our solution using the Atelier platform, which is based on Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities allows for every answer to be generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cites passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, ensuring that answers are grounded in validated material." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities will enable the intelligent assistance tool to provide quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards, tax doctrine, legal texts, and collective bargaining agreements for payroll and social." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The hybrid retrieval approach, combining lexical and semantic search, will facilitate contextualized answers that are relevant to the user's query." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting assistance, you would utilize the template-guided drafting capability, which allows for the creation of client letters, correspondence, mission notes, file memos, and syntheses. the template-guided drafting capability, which allows for the creation of client letters, correspondence, mission notes, file memos, and syntheses will enable professionals to efficiently draft high-quality documents while ensuring that the content is accurate and reliable. the Atelier platform, which is based on Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities multi-document synthesis capability will facilitate the handling of client files by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, proposing a checklist of verifications, and flagging potential anomalies for human review." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will support the continuity of missions between collaborators and enable efficient resumption of work on client files." ;
